---
layout: base.njk
title: The Alpenmilch Birthday Fairy
description: Answers to your questions about Germany's celebrated Alpenmilch Birthday Fairy.
---
<header class="hero">
  <img class="hero__image" src="/img/cosumes.png" alt="The protectors of Germany's colorful folk ways at their recent convention" width="1448" height="1086">
</header>

<main class="content">
  <section class="intro">
    <h1>The Alpenmilch Birthday Fairy</h1>
    <p>We, the protectors of Germany's colorful folk ways, welcome you to this website that we set up to answer questions about the Alpenmilch Birthday Fairy.</p>
    <p>If you are here, you probably have questions about Germany's celebrated Alpenmilch birthday fairy. The FAQs below should clear things up.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    {% for item in faq %}
    <div class="faq__item">
      <h3 class="faq__question">
        <button class="faq__toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-{{ loop.index }}" id="faq-question-{{ loop.index }}">
          <span>{{ item.question }}</span>
          <span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
      </h3>
      <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-answer-{{ loop.index }}" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-{{ loop.index }}" hidden>
        {{ item.answer | safe }}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
</main>
